#+TITLE: Beacon launch readiness
#+SUBTITLE: Pilot health from the product database, refreshed every morning

* Activation

Activation pulled ahead of signups after guided import shipped on May 4. Twelve weeks in, 79% of new teams reach a first dashboard.

#+name: activation_chart
#+begin_src chart line
title: Weekly signups and activated teams
x: week
y: signups, activated
source: weekly_activation
height: 300
#+end_src

#+name: arr_chart
#+begin_src chart bar
title: New ARR by plan
x: month
y: self_serve, team, enterprise
source: arr_by_plan
height: 280
#+end_src

